        "original_id": "6f91df24-7a8c-5d4b-af6b-0e7ed6381f48",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lisa Simpson, Matt Groening, James L. Brooks, Helena Štáchová\n- Works: The Simpsons\n- Roles: Cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, voice actor, voice of Lisa Simpson\n- Topics: Character creation, Czech dubbing\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954, and he is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- While waiting to meet James L. Brooks, Matt Groening created and designed Lisa Simpson.\n- Helena Štáchová provided the Czech-language voice of Lisa Simpson in the Czech version of the American animated sitcom The Simpsons.",
